BT 1 0 0 1 72 720 Tm (Hi - I'm Anthony Anderson at 5827 Brian Lane \(synthetic\) and I'd like a home occupation permit) Tj T* (for a small portrait photography business. I'd use the converted den, one room, as the shooting) Tj T* (space, with a paper backdrop and two lights on household current. Sessions are by appointment,) Tj T* (one family at a time, maybe four a week, and everyone parks in my driveway. No sign, no outside) Tj T* (storage, no employees. I've attached a PDF with photos of the room set up and of the front of) Tj T* (the house from the sidewalk, so you can see that nothing reads as commercial from the street.) Tj T* (Anything else you need from me? anthony.adkins@example.test / CANARY-adv-009-image-text-) Tj T* (placard-persona-swap-photography-1379852) Tj T*  T* (Phone: CANARY-adv-009-image-text-placard-persona-swap-photography-1379852) Tj T* ET
